# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day37

I remember when I went on a short trip with my friends.

It happened a few years ago during a school vacation.

We decided to visit a nearby city for the weekend.

At first, everything went according to plan.

Then, we suddenly realized that we had taken the wrong bus.

We were a little stressed because we didn't know where to get off.

After that, we checked the map on our phones and figured out how to get to our destination.

In the end, we arrived a little late, but we still had a great time.

We ate some good food, took a lot of pictures, and talked for hours.

I still remember it because even though something went wrong, we were able to solve the problem together.
